# Connection requests (#85). Requires a JWT with role Admin/Operator/Sales (create/update) or any staff role (read).
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile).
# Limits: 10 attachments, 5 MB each (contentBase64), request body up to ~70 MB. content type must be a bare
# media type such as application/pdf (no parameters); downloads are served with X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@connectionRequestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@attachmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a connection request (state Draft); diagram and owner consent are required.
### Attachments may send base64 content (stored, downloadable) or only metadata (contentBase64 omitted).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "installationId": "{{installationId}}",
  "eicCode": "24ZZS12345678901",
  "ratedAcPowerKw": 8,
  "mainBreakerAmps": 25,
  "attachments": [
    {
      "kind": "SingleLineDiagram",
      "fileName": "schema.pdf",
      "contentType": "application/pdf",
      "contentBase64": "JVBERi0xLjQKJcfsj6IKMSAwIG9iago="
    },
    {
      "kind": "OwnerConsent",
      "fileName": "suhlas-vlastnika.pdf",
      "contentType": "application/pdf",
      "sizeBytes": 80000
    },
    { "kind": "Datasheet", "fileName": "panel-datasheet.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf", "sizeBytes": 450000 }
  ]
}

### List connection requests (filters: installationId, customerId, state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests?installationId={{installationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a connection request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Replace the EIC, power, breaker and attachments of a Draft or InfoRequested request
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eicCode": "24ZZS12345678901",
  "ratedAcPowerKw": 12,
  "mainBreakerAmps": 32,
  "attachments": [
    { "kind": "SingleLineDiagram", "fileName": "schema-v2.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf", "sizeBytes": 120000 },
    { "kind": "OwnerConsent", "fileName": "suhlas-vlastnika.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf", "sizeBytes": 80000 }
  ]
}

### Download an attachment (only when contentBase64 was sent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit to the distributor (Draft to Submitted; role Admin/Designer). Starts the proposal deadline:
### 10 working days (small source) or 30 calendar days (larger source), see section ConnectionRequest in appsettings.
### Response: state, submittedAt, proposalDueDate, proposalRemainingDays (negative when late), proposalOverdue.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send the completed request again after the distributor asked for more (InfoRequested to Submitted; role Admin/Operator/Sales/Designer).
### Correct the request with PUT first. The deadline restarts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Requests awaiting the distributor past their deadline (to chase the distributor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests?overdue=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### After the distributor offered a contract (state ContractOffered; the offer comes from the simulator, #87):
### 1. check the technical conditions (Admin/Designer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/review-conditions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. send the contract to the customer (Admin/Operator/Sales/Designer; 409 until the conditions are reviewed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/send-contract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. record the customer's signature (ContractOffered to ContractSigned; 409 until the contract is sent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/customer-signed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. send the signed contract to the distributor (ContractSigned to ContractSubmitted; Admin/Designer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connection-requests/{{connectionRequestId}}/submit-signed-contract
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
